103
00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.000
A few more things.

104
00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.480
In a note from the
twenty-first of October,

105
00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:44.640
Kpler forecasts refined products
demand falling two point four million

106
00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:49.040
