a recovery of two point five million

107
00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.080
next year.

108
00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:54.880
The US Maritime Administration has
approved an offshore LNG export port

109
00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:58.480
