point two billion dollars,

110
00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.960
gCaptain reported.

111
00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:04.720
SEFE has signed a binding twenty-year
deal for one million tonnes a year

112
00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.320
from Ksi Lisims LNG.

113
00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.240
Sea drones hit a container
ship off Bulgaria.

114
00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:11.600
The crew is safe.

115
00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:16.400
And shut-in figures for Hurricane
Isaias from the Bureau of Safety and

116
00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:19.680
Environmental Enforcement, due
on the sixteenth of October,

117
00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:20.800
still haven't appeared.

118
00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.200
What to watch next. On
Sunday, the first of November,

119
00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.720
Iran's stated start of action
against Sinokor tankers,

120
00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:31.560
