121
00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.360
On Monday, a Russian diesel
tanker is due in Norfolk.

122
00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:38.240
Tuesday brings the US midterms.

123
00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:42.960
And on Wednesday, the EIA weekly for
